flowchart TD
  Start[Task received] --> Profile[Build TaskProfile]
  Profile --> Safety{Safety or authority block?}
  Safety -- yes --> Block[BLOCKED and explain]
  Safety -- no --> Native{Native direct route sufficient?}
  Native -- yes --> Direct[Direct route]
  Native -- no --> Match[Match manifest and scope]
  Match --> Need{Director or orchestration needed?}
  Need -- no --> Specialist[Select specialist or tool]
  Need -- yes --> Director[Select one domain Director]
  Director --> Graph[Create ExecutionGraph]
  Specialist --> Decision[Record RouteDecision]
  Graph --> Decision
  Decision --> Execute[Execute with budgets and gates]
  Execute --> Reevaluate{New evidence changes profile?}
  Reevaluate -- yes --> Profile
  Reevaluate -- no --> Verify[Verification]
